    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="69.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 69.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gyf hwá æfter ðam wite crauian [wille], beo he his weres scyldig wið ðone cyningc.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone [of my reeves] shall demand a fine [in such a case], he shall forfeit his wergeld to the king.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif hwa æfter ðam wite crafige, beo he his weres scyldig wið þone cingc.</ab>
      </div>
